        "original_id": "acc4c6fa-b49f-5ef7-935f-2b50b5cc6251",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rihanna, Ester Dean, Maureen Anne McDonald, Adam Rex\n- Organizations: Stargate\n- Products: \"Dancing in the Dark\", Home: Original Motion Picture Soundtrack, \"Home\", \"The True Meaning of Smekday\"\n- Topics: soundtrack albums, film songs, animation films, children's books\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Rex wrote \"The True Meaning of Smekday\", a children's book published in 2007.\n- \"Home\" is a 2015 animated film based on Adam Rex's 2007 children's book \"The True Meaning of Smekday\".\n- Home: Original Motion Picture Soundtrack is the soundtrack album for the 2015 film \"Home\".\n- Rihanna recorded \"Dancing in the Dark\" for the soundtrack to the 2015 film \"Home\".\n- Ester Dean, Maureen Anne McDonald, Rihanna, and Stargate wrote \"Dancing in the Dark\".\n- Stargate produced \"Dancing in the Dark\".",
